  "position": 140,
  "seoTitle": "SR Latch Using NAND Gates: Circuit and Truth Table",
  "seoDescription": "Build an SR latch from two cross-coupled NAND gates. Why the NAND version is active low, and why both inputs low is forbidden.",
  "keywords": [
    "sr latch using nand gates",
    "nand latch",
